// objects several roots reach, none alone (naturalize.py)
//
// The ROM's NewtonScript functions that more than one object holds: the
// compiler shared one function object wherever the same method was put in
// several protos or apps, so it is defined here once and named after the
// first slot it was found in (a _2, _3 suffix tells same-named ones apart).
// They come in families: button and radio-button click handling
// (protoTextButton, protoRadioButton), the overview list shared by
// protoOverview and NewtApp's newtOverLayout, the clock in protoTimeButton
// and protoClockShowBar, the sender/emporium/persona popups, the entry
// headers of NewtApp (newtEntryPageHeader, newtEntryRollHeader), the In/Out
// Box soup, the Calendar's meeting helpers (calendar and calendarStuff /
// globalHeapvarwannabes), the Find slip's finders (soupFinder,
// compatibleFinder), and the soup prototypes' ...Xmit methods.

